# Local-only reference-tree and profile/placement validation staging files
# (clade-HMM builder, MID-PIWI reference tree, domain/clade placement
# validation, and their tests/notebooks). Historical roadmap reference: B5/B6
# (see documentation/SCIENTIFIC_STATE.md §5) — not the name of this rule.
#
# These rules exist only to keep broad Git staging (e.g. `git add -A`) from
# sweeping these files into an unrelated commit. They do not represent a
# scientific rejection of this work, and they do not represent integration.
# They also do not make these files backed up — a separate, verified
# byte-for-byte external copy is the backup; this list only affects staging.
#
# When any of these components is formally reintegrated through its own
# reviewed PR, its ignore rule below must be removed (or deliberately
# replaced) in that same PR.
documentation/pago_annotation_ontology.md
notebooks/11_reference_profiles_and_tree.ipynb
notebooks/12_profile_validation.ipynb
src/pago_pipeline/clade_hmm_build.py
src/pago_pipeline/clade_hmm_build_snapshot.py
